<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Lbry on 0x32++</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/lbry/</link><description>Recent content in Lbry on 0x32++</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 09:36:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/lbry/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Cascading Updates</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/updates/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 09:36:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/updates/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Having been a bit lazy in not updating my Hugo version since I started which was recently breaking one of my Github actions, I decided do do that.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This lead to an cascading update cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Updating Hugo version broke the theme I was using.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Updating the theme broke the Tweet shortcode, no longer on Twitter so edited those post which referenced my old Twitter account.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Updating the Hugo version, broke the Github Action which was building and uploaded to S3. This was due to newer versions of Hugo now having an &amp;ldquo;extended&amp;rdquo; and &amp;ldquo;with_deploy&amp;rdquo; versions.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Raised a PR against the Github action to update to use the &amp;ldquo;with_deploy&amp;rdquo; version.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Still a couple of deprecated warning and fixing background and social icon links to sort out but at least now running against the latest version of Hugo.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>BBC Twitter Bot Fun</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/bbcbot/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Jan 2022 13:48:47 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/bbcbot/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;More fun playing with BBC Twitter Bot.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;https://tco/ks0jhudxdM&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.co/xBabCMPWCX"&gt;https://t.co/xBabCMPWCX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;https://tco/jVpUMLBa8D&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;https://tco/Rt3DOf1FOh&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>10 PRINT6502</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/10print6502/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Dec 2020 15:15:26 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/10print6502/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;BBC Micro machine code take on &lt;a href="https://10print.org/"&gt;C64 10 Print&lt;/a&gt; one line random pattern generator.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Code at Github &lt;a href="https://github.com/alastairhm/beebasm/blob/master/examples/10print.asm"&gt;10print.asm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure class="wp-caption alignnone"&gt;&#10; &lt;a data-flickr-embed="true" data-header="true" data-footer="false"&#10; data-context="false"&#10; href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/50706346667"&#10; title="10 PRINT 6502"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50706346667_1e2bf3b7a9_c.jpg" width="800" alt="10 PRINT 6502" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;script async src="//embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption class="wp-caption-text"&gt;10 PRINT 6502&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="code-copy" type="button" hidden aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="code-copy-label" aria-hidden="true"&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-asm" data-lang="asm"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;PRINT&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Using&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;BeebASM&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;assembler&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;\&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;Alastair&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;Montgomery&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;INCLUDE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;lib&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;constants.asm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;seed&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;70&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ORG&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2000&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.start&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;LDA&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;#23&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;STA&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;seed&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;LDA&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;#63&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;STA&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;seed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;LDX&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;#0&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.char&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;LDA&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;chartable&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;X&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;JSR&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;oswrch&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;INX&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;CPX&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;#23&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;BNE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;char&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.loop&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;JSR&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;random&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;BMI&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;two&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.one&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;LDA&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;#224&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;JMP&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.two&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;LDA&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;#225&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.print&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;JSR&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;oswrch&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;JMP&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;loop&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.finish&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;RTS&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.random&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;INCLUDE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;lib&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;random.asm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.chartable&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;EQUB&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;22&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;EQUB&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;23&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;224&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;224&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;48&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;EQUB&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;23&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;225&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;48&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;224&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;.end&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;SAVE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;MyCode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;start&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>10 PRINT</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/10print/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2020 16:08:20 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/10print/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;BBC Micro take on &lt;a href="https://10print.org/"&gt;C64 10 Print&lt;/a&gt; one line random pattern generator.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="code-copy" type="button" hidden aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="code-copy-label" aria-hidden="true"&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;10 MODE 0&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;20 N=RND(1):IF N &amp;gt; 0.5 THEN PRINT &amp;#34;/&amp;#34;; ELSE PRINT &amp;#34;\&amp;#34;;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;30 GOTO 20&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;RUN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.co/xQag2GKwx0"&gt;Twitter Post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Golden Tail and Kitsune's Curse New Retro Game</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/goldentail/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2020 09:08:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/goldentail/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;New retro game, looks worth getting a Amstrad CPC emulator setup to play it.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;iframe id="lbry-iframe" width="560" height="315" src="https://lbry.tv/$/embed/amstrad-cpc-golden-tail-and-kitsune-s/95790dfec48b00467037e730b8c610716e5ccf52" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://lbry.tv/@retrorecollections:a"&gt;Video Source Retro Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Juan&amp;rsquo;s games: (&lt;a href="https://www.usebox.net/jjm/"&gt;https://www.usebox.net/jjm/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Buy physical copies of these games:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.polyplay.xyz/navi.php?qs=golden+tail"&gt;Golden Tail&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.polyplay.xyz/navi.php?qs=Kitsune+curse"&gt;Kitsune Curse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mree</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/mree/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2020 13:51:27 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/mree/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Mr. Ee from Micro Power for the BBC Micro nice variation on the Pacman theme.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;iframe id="lbry-iframe" width="560" height="315" src="https://lbry.tv/$/embed/BBC-Mirco-MrEE/8c37287bd9782db6434ff90701d3909bb9843b5c" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.bbcmicro.co.uk/game.php?id=85"&gt;Play Online at BBC Mirco&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Acorn Electron Sound Mod</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/acornmod/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2020 08:31:48 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/acornmod/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Interest video about modding the Acorn Electron.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;iframe id="lbry-iframe" width="560" height="315" src="https://lbry.tv/$/embed/acorn-electron-audio-out-scart-mod/60586299238a4928e8493fe5532f2ff890b7dbee" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;</description></item><item><title>Hugo Lbry Shortcode</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/lbry_shortcode/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2020 13:50:32 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/lbry_shortcode/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;One thing I like about Hugo is how easy it is to expand its functionality with your own code.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;For example was able to create a &lt;a href="https://gohugo.io/content-management/shortcodes/"&gt;shortcode&lt;/a&gt; to embed &lt;a href="https://lbry.tv/"&gt;Lbry.tv&lt;/a&gt; videos into a post in around five minutes.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;First I created an empty file &lt;code&gt;layouts/shortcodes/lbry.html&lt;/code&gt; which I pasted the basic embed code take from the share button on one of their videos.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/lbry_embed.jpg" alt="Share button"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;&#10; &lt;button class="code-copy" type="button" hidden aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="code-copy-label" aria-hidden="true"&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-html" data-lang="html"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;iframe&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;lbry-iframe&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;width&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;560&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;height&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;315&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;https://lbry.tv/$/embed/this-new-fedora-powered-thinkpad-p53-is/097106eb68aebc90b33d83bb053467af942a8e20&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;allowfullscreen&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;iframe&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then parameterized this so that the src url can be changed.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>The Pit New Retro Game</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/thepit/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2020 09:08:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/thepit/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;New retro game, looks worth getting a Commodore emulator setup to play it.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This style of game is one of my favorites, loved Boulder Dash and Repton.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;iframe id="lbry-iframe" width="560" height="315" src="https://lbry.tv/$/embed/8bit-nibble-the-pit-new-commodore-plus-4/2059e72eb0251e8a354e20834b0c9ee58f0e46e9" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://lbry.tv/@retrorecollections:a"&gt;Video Source Retro Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20260305064809/http://plus4world.powweb.com/software/The_Pit"&gt;The Pit Download&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20210422064903/http://plus4world.powweb.com/play/the_pit"&gt;Play Online&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>